'''Dessert Witch - Obsession''' (お菓子の魔女・執着, ''Okashi no Majo・Shicchaku'', '''Sweets Witch - Obsession''') is a [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] enemy that appears in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dessert Witch - Obsession
|image = E 274.png
|appearance = [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
This form is the larger and stronger one, with a high damage output but a relatively slow attack rate. Her bite attack may look like it has a specified range because of the formed gap between her head and body, but targets a wider area. Still, treat her like most other enemy units with this kind of area of effect.

==Strategy==
The obsession form may be bulky in health and an annoyance for her powerful bite attack, but the fight should not be difficult as long as you do not get out-stalled. Just stack up on long-range attack cats like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and at least one heavy hitter such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. As long as they can outrange this form of Dessert Witch, all you need to do is protect them by spamming other smaller cats. The doll form, on the other hand, should be an easy kill and not require any particular strategies.

If you have [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]], [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]], or any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] from [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event|the collaboration event]], use them. Since both forms of the Dessert Witch are [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witches]], then they will become much easier to defeat due to the collab units' Witch Killer ability.

